<!DOCTYPE html>

<html class="light" lang="it"><head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" name="viewport"/>
<script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com?plugins=forms,container-queries"></script>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@200;300;400;500;600;700;800&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@100..700,0..1&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@100..700,0..1&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet"/>
<script id="tailwind-config">
        tailwind.config = {
            darkMode: "class",
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        "surface-container": "#edeeea",
                        "on-primary-container": "#38593a",
                        "error": "#9e422c",
                        "secondary-dim": "#4c564b",
                        "tertiary-dim": "#505545",
                        "primary-fixed": "#c6edc4",
                        "on-surface": "#2f3430",
                        "on-primary-fixed-variant": "#426344",
                        "on-tertiary": "#f6fbe6",
                        "tertiary-fixed-dim": "#e3e8d3",
                        "surface-container-high": "#e6e9e4",
                        "surface": "#faf9f6",
                        "on-tertiary-fixed-variant": "#636858",
                        "on-secondary-container": "#4b5449",
                        "outline": "#777c77",
                        "on-surface-variant": "#5c605c",
                        "error-container": "#fe8b70",
                        "on-secondary-fixed": "#394237",
                        "outline-variant": "#afb3ae",
                        "surface-container-highest": "#e0e4de",
                        "surface-tint": "#456646",
                        "on-background": "#2f3430",
                        "background": "#faf9f6",
                        "secondary-fixed": "#dbe5d7",
                        "inverse-on-surface": "#9d9d9a",
                        "on-primary": "#e4ffe0",
                        "secondary": "#586256",
                        "inverse-primary": "#d7fed4",
                        "surface-dim": "#d6dbd5",
                        "on-error-container": "#742410",
                        "error-dim": "#5c1202",
                        "on-tertiary-container": "#585e4e",
                        "surface-container-lowest": "#ffffff",
                        "primary": "#456646",
                        "tertiary-fixed": "#f1f6e1",
                        "surface-variant": "#e0e4de",
                        "secondary-fixed-dim": "#cdd7c9",
                        "primary-dim": "#395a3b",
                        "on-secondary": "#f2fced",
                        "primary-container": "#c6edc4",
                        "primary-fixed-dim": "#b8deb6",
                        "inverse-surface": "#0d0f0d",
                        "on-error": "#fff7f6",
                        "tertiary-container": "#f1f6e1",
                        "secondary-container": "#dbe5d7",
                        "surface-container-low": "#f4f4f0",
                        "on-primary-fixed": "#264629",
                        "surface-bright": "#faf9f6",
                        "on-tertiary-fixed": "#464c3c",
                        "on-secondary-fixed-variant": "#555e53",
                        "tertiary": "#5c6151"
                    },
                    fontFamily: {
                        "headline": ["Manrope", "sans-serif"],
                        "body": ["Manrope", "sans-serif"],
                        "label": ["Manrope", "sans-serif"]
                    },
                    borderRadius: {"DEFAULT": "1rem", "lg": "2rem", "xl": "3rem", "full": "9999px"},
                },
            },
        }
    </script>
<style>
        body { font-family: 'Manrope', sans-serif; }
        .material-symbols-outlined {
            font-variation-settings: 'FILL' 0, 'wght' 400, 'GRAD' 0, 'opsz' 24;
        }
    </style>
<style>
    body {
      min-height: max(884px, 100dvh);
    }
  </style>
  </head>
<body class="bg-surface text-on-surface min-h-screen pb-32">
<!-- Top Navigation Anchor -->
<header class="fixed top-0 w-full z-50 bg-[#faf9f6]/70 backdrop-blur-3xl px-6 py-4 flex justify-between items-center">
<div class="flex items-center gap-3">
<button class="w-10 h-10 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-surface-container-low text-on-surface transition-transform active:scale-90">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined">arrow_back_ios_new</span>
</button>
<h1 class="font-headline font-bold text-lg tracking-tight text-primary">Nuova Azione</h1>
</div>
<button class="font-headline font-bold text-primary hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity">Salva</button>
</header>
<main class="pt-24 px-6 max-w-2xl mx-auto space-y-12">
<!-- Preview Section (Asymmetric Editorial Style) -->
<section class="relative">
<div class="mb-4">
<span class="font-label text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface-variant opacity-60">Anteprima in tempo reale</span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-center py-16 bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl overflow-hidden relative">
<!-- Artistic background element -->
<div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20 pointer-events-none">
<div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-primary-container rounded-full blur-[100px]"></div>
<div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-48 h-48 bg-secondary-container rounded-full blur-[80px]"></div>
</div>
<!-- The Actual Button Preview -->
<div class="relative z-10 group cursor-pointer transition-transform duration-300 active:scale-95">
<div class="w-32 h-32 flex flex-col items-center justify-center bg-surface-container-lowest shadow-[0_20px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] rounded-full border border-outline-variant/10 p-4 text-center">
<div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-primary-container/30 flex items-center justify-center mb-2 text-primary">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl" data-icon="coffee">coffee</span>
</div>
<span class="font-headline font-bold text-sm text-on-surface block truncate w-full">Caffè</span>
<span class="font-body text-xs text-on-surface-variant">€ 1,20</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Form Configuration -->
<section class="space-y-8">
<!-- Name Input -->
<div class="space-y-3">
<label class="font-label text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface ml-2">Nome dell'azione</label>
<input class="w-full bg-surface-container-high border-none rounded-lg px-6 py-5 text-on-surface placeholder:text-on-surface-variant/40 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/20 font-body text-base transition-all" placeholder="Es. Caffè mattutino" type="text"/>
</div>
<!-- Icon Selector (Bento Style) -->
<div class="space-y-4">
<label class="font-label text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface ml-2">Scegli un'icona</label>
<div class="grid grid-cols-4 gap-3 bg-surface-container-low p-4 rounded-xl">
<button class="aspect-square flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-primary text-on-primary shadow-sm">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-icon="coffee">coffee</span>
</button>
<button class="aspect-square flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-highest transition-colors">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-icon="smoking_rooms">smoking_rooms</span>
</button>
<button class="aspect-square flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-highest transition-colors">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-icon="newspaper">newspaper</span>
</button>
<button class="aspect-square flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-highest transition-colors">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-icon="restaurant">restaurant</span>
</button>
<button class="aspect-square flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-highest transition-colors">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-icon="directions_bus">directions_bus</span>
</button>
<button class="aspect-square flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-highest transition-colors">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-icon="local_gas_station">local_gas_station</span>
</button>
<button class="aspect-square flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-surface-container-lowest text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-highest transition-colors">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-icon="shopping_basket">shopping_basket</span>
</button>
<button class="aspect-square flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-surface-container-low border border-dashed border-outline-variant text-on-surface-variant">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-icon="add">add</span>
</button>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Amount Input -->
<div class="space-y-3">
<label class="font-label text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-on-surface ml-2">Importo predefinito (€)</label>
<div class="relative group">
<input class="w-full bg-surface-container-high border-none rounded-lg px-6 py-5 text-on-surface font-headline font-extrabold text-2xl focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary/20 transition-all" placeholder="0,00" step="0.01" type="number"/>
<div class="absolute right-6 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 flex gap-2">
<button class="px-3 py-1 bg-surface-container-highest rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-on-surface-variant">€1,20</button>
<button class="px-3 py-1 bg-surface-container-highest rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-on-surface-variant">€5,00</button>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Options Toggle -->
<div class="flex items-center justify-between p-6 bg-surface-container-low rounded-xl">
<div class="flex flex-col">
<span class="font-headline font-semibold text-on-surface">Conferma immediata</span>
<span class="font-body text-xs text-on-surface-variant">Esegui senza chiedere conferma</span>
</div>
<button class="w-12 h-6 bg-primary rounded-full relative flex items-center px-1">
<div class="w-4 h-4 bg-on-primary rounded-full absolute right-1"></div>
</button>
</div>
</section>
<!-- Informational Footer -->
<section class="p-8 border border-outline-variant/10 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest">
<div class="flex gap-4 items-start">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-xl" data-icon="info">info</span>
<p class="font-body text-sm text-on-surface-variant leading-relaxed">
                    Le Azioni Rapide ti permettono di registrare spese ricorrenti con un solo tocco dalla dashboard principale. Potrai organizzarle o eliminarle in qualsiasi momento dalle impostazioni.
                </p>
</div>
</section>
</main>
<!-- Bottom Navigation Shell (Filtered: Active set to Impostazioni as this is a sub-page of settings/config) -->
<nav class="fixed bottom-0 left-0 w-full flex justify-around items-center px-4 pt-3 pb-8 bg-[#faf9f6]/70 backdrop-blur-3xl rounded-t-[3rem] shadow-[0_-4px_40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] z-50">
<div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-[#2f3430]/50 px-6 py-2 transition-transform active:scale-95">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-icon="dashboard">dashboard</span>
<span class="font-manrope text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Dashboard</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-[#2f3430]/50 px-6 py-2 transition-transform active:scale-95">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-icon="account_balance_wallet">account_balance_wallet</span>
<span class="font-manrope text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Patrimonio</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-[#2f3430]/50 px-6 py-2 transition-transform active:scale-95">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-icon="trending_up">trending_up</span>
<span class="font-manrope text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Crescita</span>
</div>
<div class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center bg-[#456646] text-[#ffffff] rounded-full px-6 py-2 transition-transform active:scale-95">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined" data-icon="settings">settings</span>
<span class="font-manrope text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Impostazioni</span>
</div>
</nav>
<!-- Decorative Bottom Blur -->
<div class="fixed bottom-0 w-full h-12 bg-gradient-to-t from-surface to-transparent pointer-events-none z-40"></div>
</body></html>
